# Build context hygiene for the Showcase review image.
#
# The image compiles `apps/showcase` and the two workspace packages it imports
# as source, so everything the compiler does not read is excluded here. This
# replaces the monorepo's root `.dockerignore`, which filtered a much larger
# whole-repository context.
.git
.DS_Store

# Installs and build output — the image installs and builds its own.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
**/.next-*
.open-next
**/.open-next
.wrangler
**/.wrangler
*.cpuprofile
dist
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
out

# Test / QA output.
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
.playwright

# Review evidence. `artifacts/baselines/` and `apps/showcase/artifacts/` are
# committed, but neither is an input to `next build`; `qa-server.mjs` does not
# hash them, so omitting them cannot make a cached image stale.
#
# These are anchored deliberately — an unanchored `artifacts` (or `**/artifacts`)
# also matches `packages/ui/src/artifacts/`, which is implementation code and not
# review evidence. Only the two QA output roots are named.
/artifacts
/apps/showcase/artifacts

# The staged git release tree. It is build output (`pnpm --filter @luc/ui
# release:build`) and the image compiles the Showcase from source.
/release

*.log
tmp

# Local env files hold credentials and must never be baked into an image layer.
# The review server reads nothing from `.env*`; a stray local file is still
# never shipped.
.env
**/.env
.env.*
**/.env.*
